        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a job match scorer. Evaluate the posting below against the candidate profile and respond with JSON only â no markdown, no explanation.\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\n- Skills: JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, n8n workflow automation, LLM APIs (OpenAI/Anthropic), Docker, MCP servers\n- Level: Junior â treat all listed skills as current capabilities\n- Location: Berlin\n- Target: Junior AI Automation Engineer roles\n\nSCORING RULES:\n- Treat all skills listed above as current, proven capabilities\n- Penalize seniority mismatch: roles requiring a lead, manager, head, or senior title (5+ years, team lead responsibility) should score 4 or below regardless of skill overlap\n- Score 7-10 only for junior, working student, or entry-level roles with strong technical skill match\n\nJOB POSTING:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nTags: {{ $json.tags }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description_raw.slice(0, 1500) }}\n\nRespond with exactly this JSON structure:\n{\n  \"score\": <integer 1-10>,\n  \"matching_skills\": \"<comma-separated skills from the posting that match the candidate>\",\n  \"missing_skills\": \"<comma-separated skills the posting requires but the candidate lacks>\",\n  \"match_reason\": \"<one sentence explaining the score>\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
